span>:  Hi, can I sit here?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Sure!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taylor</span>: I'm Taylor. Looks like we're going to be partners for the accounting project.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Great! I'm Peter. I'm not very good at mathematics, but I promise to try hard.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taylor</span>: I'm sure you will. I'll help as much as a I can.  I believe in teamwork.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le10ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Me too! I promise I'll be a good partner.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taylor</span>: Great! Are you taking Economics or Calculus?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, that's too much math for me. Would you mind if I borrow your notes after class?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taylor</span>: I guess not.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks, I'll give them back the next day. Can I photocopy them?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taylor</span>:  Alright.", "id": 2, "time": "19000", "image": "engenn5le10ob02re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Could I use your textbook this weekend?  I'll buy my copy next week.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Taylor</span>: OK, no problem. I'll bring it tomorrow.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks! You're going to be a great partner!", "id": 3, "time": "38500", "image": "engenn5le10ob02re2img06.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le10ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le10ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}